athi Dhari Asaji, Preme Kari Bhakti Prabhu Tuj Mangu Mukti Vasji, Shri \\\\\\\"Panchasara\\\\\\\" Parshva Ne Bhave I Do Vandana.\\\"}]\\n2a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"14\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Chant Mantra: \\\\\\\"Om Hree Arham Shri \\\\\\\"Panchasara\\\\\\\" Parshvanathaya Namah\\\\\\\"\\\"}]\\n2b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"15\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Trust: Shri Panchasara Parshvanath Jain Derasar Trust, Hemchandracharya Road, Piplani Sheri, Patan-384265, District-Mehsana, Gujarat State, India. Phone: 02766-222278, 02766-220559.\\\"}]\\n2c:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"16\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Character of Purushadaniya Parshvanath Bhagwan Part-4 (Invitation to dream readers):\\\"}]\\n2d:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"17\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"King Ashwasen calls the dream readers i.e. the experts and makes them sit on the seats in the royal meeting room of the royal court and with fruits and flowers in his hand, he politely tells the king that today Vamadevi, while sleeping on a high quality bed in her royal bedroom, in a half-sleep state, has seen the following fourteen great dreams, and after seeing them, she woke up from sleep. These dreams were of Gaja Vrishabha etc. The king requests, O dear devan, what will be the beneficial outcome of this generous fourteen great dreams?\\\"}]\\n2e:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"18\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"After this, those who read the dream signs became very happy after hearing and understanding the story presented by King Ashwasen, and speaking words according to the dream scriptures, said - O Devanupriya, the great dreams that Vamadevi has seen are very auspicious. These m\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"eanings are those who provide benefit, benefit to people, benefit to son, benefit to happiness and benefit to the state. Certainly, in the family of Vamadevi, a son of Priyadarshi form will be born, who is like a flag, like a lamp, like a mountain, like a mug, like a tilak, and one who enhances the revolution, give